  m_text: 'You are the last ember of a fallen temple.

    Roll onto glowing rune plates to light lanterns, raise bridges and open gates.

    Some things you cannot press yourself - release weights, rafts and stones and let them do it.

    Light the three lanterns of dawn and rekindle the beacon.


    W A S D / ARROWS   roll        SPACE   jump

    R   back to checkpoint        ESC   pause        F   photo mode'
